<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Berserk Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 5
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> berserk
</pre>
<p>Fierce warriors, though perpetually on the edge of control, the Barbarian has 
unique skills derived from a need to support their combat-focused activities. 
By channeling their energy, a Barbarian may go berserk. While in a berserk 
state, the Barbarian is faster and has more constitution and hit points, and 
going berserk heals some of their wounds at once. The better your berserk skill 
and constitution, the stronger and longer it is.
</p><p>Going berserk takes a lot of endurance: you need at least 100 to try, and even 
a failed try costs some. You can't go berserk again while you are berserk, and 
if you are hasted already, berserk doesn't make you any faster.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Endurance</a>
</pre>




</div>